WEBVTT

NOTE Silent screen recording — captions follow what is on screen, not speech.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.800
Add plugin marketplace — paste https://github.com/mitunmanav/anyone-can-code
Git ref: main · then click Add marketplace.

00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:05.200
Marketplace added (toast: anyone-can-code-marketplace is already added is OK).

00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:07.800
Plugins list / settings — find Anyone Can Code after install.

00:00:07.800 --> 00:00:10.500
Open Anyone Can Code — scroll to Hooks on the plugin page.

00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:17.500
Hooks settings — turn ON and trust every ACC hook.
This is required. Codex will not auto-trust hooks.

00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:21.500
Confirm skills/tools are enabled on the plugin page.

00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:27.200
Start a chat with Anyone Can Code selected — describe what you want in plain English.
